    "sentence_translations": [
      "New Year Plan",
      "",
      "As the New Year arrived, Little Ming decided to write a plan for 2017.",
      "“In 2017, I’ll go running and do exercises every morning; study English for 1 hour every day;”",
      "“practice calligraphy for half a day every weekend; read a book every week; go on a long distance travel every half a year…”",
      "When Little Ming’s mom saw the list she took out a paper from the bookshelf and said:",
      "“This is the same as your plan for 2016! Have you done any of these things during 2016?”",
      "Little Ming said: “Uh, not yet. But I’ll certainly do all the things this year!”",
      "His mom said: “You said the same thing last year…”"
    ]
